<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P affirms Mitsubishi Corp's AA- rating.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P affirms Mitsubishi Corp's AA- rating.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Friday that it had affirmed its AA- rating for trading house Mitsubishi Corp's 500-billion yen shelf registration programme.</p>
<p>The ratings reflect the company's strong trading business, a fair amount of success in diversification and investment and a satisfactory capital structure, S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
<p>The outlook for the rating is stable, S&amp;P said.</p>
</text>
